v":5207.9,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":16371.3,"ev_to_ebitda":5.4,"debt_to_ebitda":0.03,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-3.17,"f_score":8,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 16.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $645M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 21.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 4.19"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":41.49,"default_fair_val":41.49,"premium_pct":-57.5,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":12.5,"pe_forward":11,"pb_trailing":2.7,"pb_forward":2.4,"div_yield":0.94,"ps_ratio":3.2,"fcf_to_ev":12.38,"fcf_to_mcap":7.8,"liab_to_assets":21.7,"cash_to_assets":77.9,"current_ratio":4.19,"roe":21.4,"roa":16.7,"moat":{"ticker":"BZ","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘作為中國領先的在線招聘平台，已建立起強大的品牌聲譽，尤其在藍領和服務業領域。其平台匯聚了大量求職者和企業，形成了顯著的網絡效應，使得新進入者難以複製。儘管面臨競爭，BOSS 直聘通過持續的產品創新和用戶體驗優化，鞏固了其市場地位。其定價策略能夠反映其服務的價值，並在一定程度上轉嫁成本，顯示出一定的定價權。然而，中國勞動力市場的結構性變化和宏觀經濟波動可能對其定價能力構成挑戰。","comment_en":"As a leading online recruitment platform in China, BOSS Zhipin has established a strong brand reputation, particularly in the blue-collar and service sectors. Its platform aggregates a large number of job seekers and enterprises, forming significant network effects that make it difficult for new entrants to replicate. Despite facing competition, BOSS Zhipin has consolidated its market position through continuous product innovation and user experience optimization. Its pricing strategy reflects the value of its services and allows for some cost pass-through, indicating a degree of pricing power. However, structural changes in China's labor market and macroeconomic fluctuations may pose challenges to its pricing capabilities."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"在互聯網內容與資訊行業，專利和監管壁壘相對較弱，主要依賴於技術迭代和數據優勢。BOSS 直聘的競爭優勢更多體現在其運營效率和網絡效應上，而非嚴格意義上的專利保護。然而，作為一家在中國運營的互聯網公司，其業務受到嚴格的監管環境影響。公司需要持續遵守不斷變化的數據隱私、內容審核和勞動法規，這構成了一種運營上的壁壘，但也可能限制其業務擴張的靈活性。監管的變化是影響其長期發展的重要因素。","comment_en":"In the internet content and information industry, patent and regulatory barriers are relatively weak, primarily relying on technological iteration and data advantages. BOSS Zhipin's competitive edge lies more in its operational efficiency and network effects rather than strict patent protection. However, as an internet company operating in China, its business is significantly influenced by a stringent regulatory environment. The company must continuously comply with evolving data privacy, content moderation, and labor regulations, which constitute an operational barrier but may also limit its business expansion flexibility. Regulatory changes are crucial factors affecting its long-term development."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於企業用戶而言，更換招聘平台意味著需要重新適應新的界面、流程，並可能面臨招聘效率的暫時下降，這構成了一定的轉換成本。對於求職者，雖然更換平台的成本較低，但他們傾向於集中在主流平台以獲得更多機會。BOSS 直聘通過其龐大的用戶基礎和高效的匹配機制，增加了用戶黏性。一旦企業和求職者習慣了平台的運作模式和數據積累，轉換到競爭對手的成本就會顯著增加，尤其是在尋找特定人才或職位時。","comment_en":"For enterprise users, switching recruitment platforms entails adapting to new interfaces and processes, potentially facing a temporary decline in recruitment efficiency, which constitutes a certain switching cost. For job seekers, while the cost of switching platforms is lower, they tend to concentrate on mainstream platforms for more opportunities. BOSS Zhipin enhances user stickiness through its vast user base and efficient matching mechanisms. Once enterprises and job seekers become accustomed to the platform's operating model and accumulated data, the cost of switching to a competitor increases significantly, especially when searching for specific talent or positions."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘的網絡效應極為顯著。平台匯聚的求職者越多，對企業的吸引力就越大；而越多的企業入駐，則為求職者提供了越豐富的職位選擇。這種正反饋循環形成了強大的網絡效應壁壘。對於求職者而言，主流平台意味著更多的機會；對於企業而言，主流平台意味著更廣泛的人才庫。這種雙邊網絡效應使得後來者難以在用戶數量和活躍度上與之匹敵，構成了堅實的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"The network effects of BOSS Zhipin are extremely significant. The more job seekers the platform attracts, the greater its appeal to enterprises; and the more enterprises join, the richer the job options provided to job seekers. This positive feedback loop forms a strong network effect barrier. For job seekers, the mainstream platform means more opportunities; for enterprises, it means a broader talent pool. This two-sided network effect makes it difficult for latecomers to compete with its user numbers and activity, constituting a solid competitive advantage."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為中國領先的在線招聘平台，BOSS 直聘通過其龐大的用戶基礎和高效的運營，實現了規模經濟。其在技術研發、市場推廣和客戶服務方面的投入，能夠攤薄到海量的用戶和交易中，從而降低單位成本。相較於小型競爭對手，BOSS 直聘在獲取用戶和維持平台運營方面具有顯著的成本優勢。這種規模優勢使其能夠提供更具競爭力的服務價格，並持續投入以鞏固其市場領導地位。","comment_en":"As a leading online recruitment platform in China, BOSS Zhipin achieves economies of scale through its vast user base and efficient operations. Its investments in technology R&D, marketing, and customer service can be spread across a massive number of users and transactions, thereby reducing per-unit costs. Compared to smaller competitors, BOSS Zhipin has a significant cost advantage in acquiring users and maintaining platform operations. This scale advantage allows it to offer more competitive service prices and to continuously invest in consolidating its market leadership."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘的優勢在於其對中國勞動力市場的深刻理解和廣泛的用戶網絡，而非傳統意義上的地理或獨特資產。其核心競爭力體現在平台數據、用戶習慣和品牌認知上，這些是通過時間和持續運營積累的。雖然其業務遍及中國，但並無特定地理區域的壟斷性優勢。其「利基」在於專注於信息對稱和效率提升，而非依賴於稀缺的自然資源或地理位置。","comment_en":"BOSS Zhipin's advantage lies in its deep understanding of the Chinese labor market and its extensive user network, rather than traditional geographical or unique assets. Its core competitiveness is reflected in platform data, user habits, and brand recognition, which have been accumulated over time and through continuous operations. Although its business spans across China, it does not possess a monopolistic advantage in any specific geographical region. Its 'niche' is in focusing on information symmetry and efficiency improvement, rather than relying on scarce natural resources or geographical locations."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘在運營效率方面表現出色。其平台通過智能算法和數據分析，能夠高效地匹配求職者與企業需求，縮短招聘週期，降低雙方的時間成本。相較於傳統招聘方式或效率較低的在線平台，BOSS 直聘的運營模式更為精簡和高效。其持續優化產品功能和用戶體驗，進一步提升了運營效率，使其能夠在激烈的市場競爭中保持領先地位，並為用戶提供高質量的服務。","comment_en":"BOSS Zhipin demonstrates excellent operational efficiency. Its platform utilizes intelligent algorithms and data analysis to efficiently match job seekers with enterprise needs, shortening recruitment cycles and reducing time costs for both parties. Compared to traditional recruitment methods or less efficient online platforms, BOSS Zhipin's operating model is more streamlined and effective. Continuous optimization of product features and user experience further enhances operational efficiency, enabling it to maintain a leading position in fierce market competition and provide high-quality services to users."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘展現了良好的資本配置能力。公司擁有健康的現金流和穩健的資產負債表，為其戰略投資和擴張提供了堅實的基礎。其將資本優先投入於技術研發、產品創新和市場拓展，以鞏固和擴大其市場領導地位。同時，公司也注重通過回購股票等方式回報股東。其穩健的財務狀況和對增長機會的精準把握，顯示出管理層在資本配置方面的智慧和遠見。","comment_en":"BOSS Zhipin demonstrates strong capital allocation capabilities. The company possesses healthy cash flow and a robust balance sheet, providing a solid foundation for its strategic investments and expansion. It prioritizes allocating capital towards technology R&D, product innovation, and market expansion to consolidate and grow its market leadership. Concurrently, the company focuses on returning value to shareholders through measures like share buybacks. Its sound financial condition and precise grasp of growth opportunities reflect management's wisdom and foresight in capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘通過持續優化用戶體驗和提供高質量的服務，有效提升了客戶留存率。對於企業用戶，平台的高效匹配和人才庫的豐富性使其難以輕易更換。對於求職者，平台的活躍度和職位機會使其保持黏性。通過不斷迭代產品功能，滿足用戶日益增長的需求，進一步鞏固了客戶忠誠度。這種高客戶留存率是其穩健增長的關鍵因素之一。","comment_en":"BOSS Zhipin effectively enhances customer retention by continuously optimizing user experience and providing high-quality services. For enterprise users, the platform's efficient matching and rich talent pool make it difficult to switch easily. For job seekers, the platform's activity and job opportunities maintain their stickiness. By continuously iterating on product features to meet users' growing needs, customer loyalty is further solidified. This high customer retention rate is one of the key factors for its stable growth."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"BOSS 直聘的商業模式具有較強的持久性，主要得益於其強大的網絡效應和用戶黏性。在中國龐大且持續增長的勞動力市場中，其作為領先招聘平台的地位相對穩固。儘管面臨宏觀經濟波動和行業監管的潛在風險，但其核心競爭力並未受到根本性動搖。只要公司能持續創新並適應市場變化，其商業模式有望保持長期的競爭優勢，類似於一個高效的「數字化收費橋」，連接供需雙方並從中獲取價值。","comment_en":"BOSS Zhipin's business model possesses strong durability, primarily due to its powerful network effects and user stickiness. Within China's large and continuously growing labor market, its position as a leading recruitment platform is relatively stable. Despite potential risks from macroeconomic fluctuations and industry regulations, its core competitive strengths remain fundamentally intact. As long as the company continues to innovate and adapt to market changes, its business model is expected to maintain long-term competitive advantages, akin to an efficient 'digital toll bridge' connecting supply and demand sides and extracting value."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"BOSS 直聘憑藉其強大的網絡效應和品牌聲譽，在中國在線招聘市場建立了顯著的護城河，尤其是在藍領和服務業領域。其平台匯聚了海量用戶，形成了難以逾越的進入壁壘。高效的運營和不斷優化的用戶體驗進一步鞏固了其市場地位和客戶留存率。儘管面臨監管風險，但其核心的「數字化收費橋」模式，通過連接供需雙方並提升效率，展現了持久的盈利能力和增長潛力。其資本配置策略亦支持其長期穩健發展。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"BOSS Zhipin has established a significant moat in China's online recruitment market, particularly in the blue-collar and service sectors, leveraging its powerful network effects and brand reputation. Its platform aggregates a massive user base, creating formidable entry barriers. Efficient operations and continuously optimized user experience further solidify its market position and customer retention. Despite regulatory risks, its core 'digital toll bridge' model, connecting supply and demand and enhancing efficiency, demonstrates durable profitability and growth potential. Its capital allocation strategy also supports its long-term stable development.","evidenceHash":"9d8a1e6b3d98737f3cbda5de0a1f18439d52a18dce005724a6789fadca48451e","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"9d8a1e6b3d98737f3cbda5de0a1f18439d52a18dce005724a6789fadca48451e","currentEvidenceHash":"9d8a1e6b3d98737f3cbda5de0a1f18439d52a18dce005724a6789fadca48451e"},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T09:00:33.278Z","evidenceHash":"c5ed49014778a9be02bbd04e7ec94f000b378ea03abfb525e0def940ec3bdadc","mcapFx":{"asOf":"2026-11-06","from":"USD","to":"CNY","fromUsdPerUnit":1,"toUsdPerUnit":0.1502900598154438,"fromObservationDate":"2026-11-06","toObservationDate":"2026-10-30"}},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T09:00:33.278Z","evidenceHash":"c5ed49014778a9be02bbd04e7ec94f000b378ea03abfb525e0def940ec3bdadc"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BZ.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BZ.png","website":"https://ir.zhipin.com","ceo":"Peng Zhao","full_time_employees":"4884","description":"Kanzhun Limited, established in 2013 and headquartered in Beijing, China, manages BOSS Zhipin, a leading online recruitment platform. This service operates within the People's Republic of China, streamlining the hiring journey by connecting individuals seeking employment with various enterprises and corporations looking to expand their teams.","description_en":"Kanzhun Limited, established in 2013 and headquartered in Beijing, China, manages BOSS Zhipin, a leading online recruitment platform. This service operates within the People's Republic of China, streamlining the hiring journey by connecting individuals seeking employment with various enterprises and corporations looking to expand their teams.","description_zh":"Kanzhun Limited（美股代碼：BZ）為 Communication Services 領域之重要企業，專注於 Internet Content & Information 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"GrandyVic Building","city":"Beijing","state":"BE","zip":"100028","country":"CN","phone":"86 10 8462 8340","full_address":"GrandyVic Building, Beijing, BE 100028, CN","range_52w":"12.57-22.49","year_high":22.49,"year_low":12.57,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":12.57,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-21","name":"Zhao Peng Jonathan","title":"director, 10 percent owner, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":1635480,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-21","name":"Zhao Peng Jonathan","title":"director, 10 percent owner, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shar